From 5f3199e3ae24077ecebfeac76b81f6f9765be58f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ut-bitra <ut-bitra@localhost>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:49:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] arm64: dts: qcom: bitra: add QCA6390 Wi-Fi 6, BQ28Z610,
 MP2650 charger, and OLED power-off rails

- Enable PCIe0 + qca6390-pmu (GPIO20/21) for QCA6390 Wi-Fi 6 (ath11k_pci)
- Enable QUPv3 wrap 2 I2C16 (0x888000) for TI BQ28Z610 2S fuel gauge @ 0x55
- Enable QUPv3 wrap 0 I2C5 (0x994000) and add clean mainline MPS MP2650 2S
  charger driver (drivers/power/supply/mp2650_charger.c) with standard
  charge_behaviour (auto, inhibit-charge bypass, force-discharge HIZ)
- Declare boot-on OLED/touchscreen LDOs (vreg_l13a_3p0, vreg_l14a_1p8,
  vreg_l2c_1p15) without always-on so regulator_late_cleanup powers off the
  unused OLED panel on headless server boots
---
 .../boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-realme-bitra.dts     | 163 ++++++++
 drivers/power/supply/Kconfig                  |   8 +
 drivers/power/supply/Makefile                 |   1 +
 drivers/power/supply/mp2650_charger.c         | 369 ++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 541 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/power/supply/mp2650_charger.c

